# SecondBrain Local needs no API keys, accounts, or cloud services.
#
# The app talks to Ollama on this endpoint by default:
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
#
# If you access the browser/PWA build from a non-local origin, allow that
# origin to call the daemon before starting it, for example:
# OLLAMA_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:43110
#
# The packaged Electron app serves itself on a stable loopback origin
# (http://127.0.0.1:43110) so notes persist between launches.
